{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_st01",
  "title": "Beg for Mercy",
  "storyCode": "DM-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cbef93749cca2403f47fe1b4a5e8a84d6b2fd7375f2b5b943f71255bc65ee6d1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You're still pushing forward?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Without treatment, you're definitely getting infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Why would I believe a devil?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "A devil, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "So many devils around me all the time, sometimes I forget we even have that word.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Gah, stop following us!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I've been keeping my distance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "And stop acting nice! If you're gonna kill us, just do it already!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Ru-Rublev, you really shouldn't provoke her...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Okay. We're going then.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Ignore her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "S-sorry!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "I don't care if I get infected! We don't need a devil's help!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "...Um.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Uh huh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "There's an abandoned hospital around here. Chernobog District Hospital.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Wanna know where it is?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Rublev...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Don't listen to her. She's trying to trick us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Let's ditch her... quick.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "See that alley over there? You take that corner and I think we can get there in less than a minute!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Okay.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "——Run!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "They're fast.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "H-How did she catch up to us so quick?! Agh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Rublev... your leg! Th-the blood is turning black...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Ugh, I could've outran her if I didn't have to save you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Sorry...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Whatever! Just be quiet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Don't let her find us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Head down that street, turn left, and you'll come to a ruined plaza.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "On the west side, that big white building, that's the hospital.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "The abandoned hospital.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "...I think... she knows we're here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Because you don't listen to me——fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Hey, devil.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Why did you tell us that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Felt like it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "How do you two know each other?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "I found him while I was out looking for food.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Rublev saved me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "And that's why you do what he says?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "No skin off my back. Whatever you want. But now it's time for you to help out your savior here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "What are you gonna make him do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Rublev...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Nothing. I told you, there's a hospital right over there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I mean, Reunion isn't dumb, so they wouldn't waste perfectly good medical supplies... So if you wanna save your little pal Rublev, you're gonna have to steal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "It's a bunch of Infected thugs over there. Thugs who murdered your family and friends.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "And that's the only place they'll have the drugs that can stop the onset of Oripathy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "So go steal, rob, loot, it's all good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Just don't expect anybody to help you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "No! Don't listen to her!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "B-But...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "No?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "He knows your name, Rublev. Do you know his?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "What does that have to do with anything?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Don't go! You can't do it! There's too many——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I... I want to try...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Rublev isn't the only one who got hurt in the Catastrophe...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "There's so much pain... I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Why aren't you listening to me?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "He doesn't have to listen to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "It's good that you wanna save those people.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Just keep that hospital in mind. They keep the supplies down in an underground storeroom.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You could get in through the vents in the parking garage, or through the sewers, as long as there's not too much toxic waste down there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You could die there though.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "C'mon, your legs are shaking! You can't do it! We were dumb to even listen to a devil in the first place!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Let's get out of here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Eeep——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Wh-What was that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Some things went down in Lungmen... wiped some stuff out here too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Why wouldn't folks have their eye on a perfectly good battlefield hospital here in Chernobog?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Why do you think... a devil like me would know that hospital so well?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Because you——Umm, ah——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I... I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "That must hurt like a bastard. I'm starting to think he's probably beyond help at this point.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "If you don't act soon..",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You might just die right here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Ah...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "You, ugh, what are you doing? Stay away from me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "To go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Or not to go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Oh... but what if it's already too late, even if you did go? There's a riot going on, it might be too hard to sneak in and grab the goods——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I-I'm going.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "——Yeah... you're dead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Why are you still listening to her? I'm the one who saved you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "But I... want to try...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "There's no way you can do it! We'll go to a drugstore, we'll find some food, that'll be enough!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I'm sorry!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Hey... wait!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "If you knew his name, maybe you could call out and stop him? Kinda sad.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "You... you tricked him! You devil!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Tricked?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I haven't told a single lie.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But hey, whether or not you believe me, that's your call.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Whether or not you believe him, that's your call too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "...I, I'm gonna go find him, nnggh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "H-He can't do anything without me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You're scared he's gonna run away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You're thinking... why did he leave you alone with me? With a devil?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Am not!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Suka! A monster like you——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Shut up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Wait here for him. Don't move.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Or I'll kill you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Nnng——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Who do you think I am?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I'm a killer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I'm the killer who destroyed this city, hurt your parents and friends.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Ah... haha. That's right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I forgot you had that blade. Look, it's got a Sarkaz charm on the hilt, and it's still bloody.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Whose blood do you think it is?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "*Whimper*... I, I don't know... you made him...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Go ahead and cry. Kids can cry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "It's all up to you... whether you live or die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "He can't do it...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You sure?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "If I hadn't dug him out of those ruins, he'd already be dead...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "He needs me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Nope... nobody needs anyone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Nobody does.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "This ruined city got quiet again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "There's a lot less resistance, after that slaughter. That's a good thing. Less effort. Less death.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But it's quiet over at the hospital too. Nothing moving over there, as far as I can tell.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "He... he didn't...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Maybe... he didn't actually go...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "It's been... Nng... so long...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "He ran away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But you saved him. Wouldn't he want to save you too?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "...I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Or maybe you're strong enough to save him, but he couldn't save you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "He... He can't do anything right!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Like when we went looking for food! He couldn't even tell there was someone else in the store!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "It's all his fault my leg got——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Where are you going?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "I... I'm going home alone...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I already told you, you leave and you die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "But he already ran off!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Hah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I can see it in your eyes. You hate him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "N-No I don't!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "But if... if he did go... it's been so long... he must be...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "——Shut up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You won't know anything until he comes back.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You can sit here thinking he's coming back, or that he's not.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But if you're thinking that he's not, if you're doubting him, hating him, that's on you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But you went right to thinking he blew it and ran off. Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Because you saved him? Because you're the strong one?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "...*whimper*.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Waaahhh——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You're still strong enough to cry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Settle down. Give it a minute and you'll be in too much pain to cry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You're young, you're not Sarkaz. So if can't take it anymore, you can tell me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I'll end it for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Wah... aahhh... waahh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You're losing consciousness.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Ah well... guess he won't make it in time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "No... I can still...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "I'll wait... for him...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You've got faith in him again. That's because you're scared to die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Kids are a good judge of character. You won't get this kind of stuff out of me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "....Hnng...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But he's definitely taking way too long.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Got maybe ten minutes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Don't worry. If it comes down to it, I'm not gonna let a kid die in pain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "...can't even whimper anymore, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "What are you thinking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Do you hate me? Or him?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Or maybe you hate yourself for sticking your nose where it didn't belong, saving that kid, and getting yourself hurt?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "...I don't...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You sure?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "So you can still talk. Guess I misjudged you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Look, Rublev.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "What do you think it is that decides what a person's gonna do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Is it a nature or nurture thing? Where they're born, how they're born? What kind of baggage they're weighed down with?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Nah, none of that matters.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "It's the whole, complete, sum total of the influences on his life, all those changing thoughts and beliefs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "And just how strong he believes in those beliefs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "You saved that kid, but you didn't really trust him completely. You looked down on him, because you saw yourself as his messiah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But him? He's easy. You saved him, he wants to save you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "When it comes to this stuff, he's stronger than you are.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Keep the blade. It's a Sarkaz blade, so I'm allowed to stand in for its owner and give it to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Wave it around, learn to swing it, sell it for cash. Whatever. It's yours.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "That's the deal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "What... are you talking about...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "R-Rublev! Are you okay?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Look!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I did it! I stole an entire box of medical supplies! Painkillers! Bandages!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Rublev...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Keep it... down. I'm not dead yet...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "O-Okay. Let me bandage your wound...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "How do you use the bandage...? Is- is this the Oripathy medicine? I-I'll open it...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Aren't... your parents doctors?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Oh... they never taught me anything. But I'll try...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "...You got hurt?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "I'm fine. Just a scratch... Somebody hit me with a piece of metal...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Idiot...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "...Hehe...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Where's... the Sarkaz?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Oh... I didn't see her when I came back... Did she stay with you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Rublev?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "...Say, um... What's... your name?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Oh? Err... Andrey.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Your whole name...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Andrey Fyodorovich Ostrovsky... heh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "What are you laughing at?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "You finally asked, Rublev.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "...Sorry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "N-No, you don't have to apologize...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "All right. How do you feel?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unyielding Child",
      "text": "Better...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Great!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "Let's go back home. I'll help you up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waifish Child",
      "text": "The grown-ups will be very happy about this box!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I smiled, watching those kids.\nIf they were going to survive, they had to kill that seed of doubt.\nYou only suffer if you survive.\nLike a moth to a flame, a worm in a hole.\nYou have to chase something, even at a cost."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Isn't that right...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "...Talulah?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
